---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="项目 · rain" description="rain 的公开项目、课程实践与持续迭代记录。" active="projects" bodyClass="interior-v2 projects-v2">
  <main id="main-content" class="interior-main projects-main">
    <header class="projects-heading v2-reveal">
      <div>
        <p class="v2-kicker">项目 · GitHub</p>
        <h1>公开仓库</h1>
      </div>
      <p>课程作业、个人项目和练习仓库。列表显示语言、star 数与最近提交时间。</p>
    </header>

    <section class="project-snapshot v2-reveal" aria-label="项目概览">
      <div><strong data-repo-count>09</strong><span>公开仓库</span></div>
      <div><strong data-repo-language-count>07</strong><span>使用语言</span></div>
      <div><strong data-repo-latest>读取中</strong><span>最近提交</span></div>
      <small>仓库数据来自 GitHub 公共接口；连接失败时使用缓存或本地清单。</small>
    </section>

    <section class="project-directory">
      <div class="interior-section-head v2-reveal">
        <div><p class="v2-kicker">仓库列表</p><h2>全部项目</h2></div>
        <span class="repo-live" data-repo-status aria-live="polite"><i></i>正在读取</span>
      </div>
      <div class="project-directory-list v2-reveal">
        <div class="github-repo-list" data-github-repos data-repo-limit="9" aria-live="polite">
          <div class="repo-skeleton"><i></i><span></span><span></span></div>
          <div class="repo-skeleton"><i></i><span></span><span></span></div>
        </div>
        <a class="project-all" href="https://github.com/rain-lei?tab=repositories" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">在 GitHub 打开仓库列表 <span>↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
